KEY: W depends on how the resonances jc≈kc land in [0,1/14). For CLOSE speeds (c'≈c) the offsets
m_j=|jc'-kc|~j|c'-c| are SMALL for many j -> big max(0,M-m) terms -> W LARGE (99,101 etc).
For FAR speeds the m_j spread -> W ~ bulk 1/686. So pairwise-windowed does NOT decorrelate CLUSTERS.
=> the near-0 equidistribution is intrinsically MULTI-speed; the 2-speed one-interval refinement fails for clusters.
